# Runbooks — {{ cluster_name }}

Day-two operations for this cluster. This is the file every alert's
`runbook_url` points at, so the section headings below are load-bearing: renaming
one breaks the links baked into `cluster_runbook_base_url`.

`task --list` is the authoritative command reference. Every command on this page
is one the generated `Taskfile.yml` defines — if a command here does not exist,
that is a bug, not a missing feature you need to install.

The reasoning behind these shapes (Flux stages, substitution, storage tiers, the
DNS split) lives in the template's
[ARCHITECTURE.md](https://git.ericsweiss.com/eric/weisssrv-cluster-template/-/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

